# Shop web deploy (CT 105 / dharmacore)

When telling the user how to deploy the live shop web app, ALWAYS paste the full PowerShell block below in the reply. Never say "the usual scp/ssh", "deploy as usual", or any shorthand that omits the commands. The user should not have to ask for the full deploy steps.

## Full deploy block (Windows laptop PowerShell)

```
cd c:\cribhub
git pull
.\scripts\build_web_shop.ps1
scp C:\cribhub\deploy\shop-web.zip root@192.168.20.101:/root/
ssh root@192.168.20.101 "rm -rf /opt/pocketbase-erp-dev/pb_public/* && unzip -o /root/shop-web.zip -d /opt/pocketbase-erp-dev/pb_public/ && ls /opt/pocketbase-erp-dev/pb_public/index.html /opt/pocketbase-erp-dev/pb_public/main.dart.js"
```

Then hard-refresh (or clear site data for) https://dharmacore.sscadcam.com/.

Also name the expected Build Info commit when a specific commit was just pushed.

